  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Mambo Ya Nyakati 30",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Hezekia aliwatumia ujumbe watu wote wa Israeli na Yuda, na pia akawaandikia barua wenyeji wa Efraimu na Manase, akiwaalika wote waje katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu Yerusalemu, ili kuiadhimisha sikukuu ya Pasaka kwa heshima yake Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme, viongozi na watu wote wa mji wa Yerusalemu waliafikiana kuiadhimisha sikukuu hiyo ya Pasaka mnamo mwezi wa pili ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badala ya mwezi wa kwanza kama ilivyokuwa kawaida, kwa sababu idadi ya makuhani waliokuwa wamekwisha kujiweka wakfu ilikuwa ndogo, nao watu walikuwa bado hawajakusanyika Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha, mpango huu ulimridhisha mfalme pamoja na watu wote waliokuwa wamekusanyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo waliamua kutoa tangazo kote nchini Israeli, kutoka Beer-sheba hadi Dani, kwamba watu waje Yerusalemu kuiadhimisha sikukuu ya Pasaka ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli. Ulikuwa umepita muda mrefu kabla watu hawajaiadhimisha Pasaka kulingana na sheria zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matarishi, kwa amri yake mfalme na maofisa wake, walipeleka barua kote nchini Israeli na Yuda. Barua hizo zilikuwa na ujumbe ufuatao:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, matarishi hao wakaenda toka mji mmoja hadi mwingine kote nchini Efraimu na Manase, wakafika hata Zebuluni. Lakini watu waliwacheka na kuwadhihaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, watu wachache miongoni mwa makabila ya Asheri, Manase na Zebuluni, walijinyenyekesha wakaja Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguvu ya Mungu ilikuwa ikifanya kazi katika Yuda, akawapa moyo kutii amri za mfalme na maofisa wake kadiri ya maagizo ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wengi sana walijumuika mjini Yerusalemu mnamo mwezi wa pili, kuiadhimisha sikukuu ya mikate isiyotiwa chachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walianza kazi, wakaziondoa madhabahu zote zilizokuwa Yerusalemu, na nyingine zote zilizotumiwa kufukizia ubani, wakazibeba na kuzitupa katika Bonde la Kidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya kumi na nne ya mwezi huo walichinja mwanakondoo wa Pasaka. Makuhani na Walawi waliona aibu, wakajitakasa na kuleta sadaka za kuteketeza katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walichukua nafasi zao hekaluni kulingana na maagizo yaliyokuwamo katika sheria za Mose, mtu wa Mungu. Walawi waliwapa makuhani damu ya tambiko, nao wakainyunyiza madhabahuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa vile wengi wa wale waliokusanyika hapo hawakuwa wamejitakasa, iliwabidi Walawi kuwachinjia wanakondoo wa Pasaka na kuwaweka wakfu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha miongoni mwa kusanyiko hilo la watu, wengi wa wale waliotoka Efraimu, Manase, Isakari na Zebuluni, walikuwa wakiiadhimisha Pasaka kinyume cha maagizo. Hii ni kwa kuwa mfalme Hezekia aliwaombea akisema, “Mwenyezi-Mungu uliye mwema, msamehe yeyote yule ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atakayekuomba kwa moyo wake wote wewe Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa babu zake, hata ingawa si msafi kulingana na sheria za utakaso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alikubali ombi la Hezekia, akawasamehe watu hao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wote waliokuwa wamekusanyika mjini Yerusalemu waliiadhimisha sikukuu ya mikate isiyotiwa chachu kwa muda wa siku saba, wakiwa na furaha kubwa. Walawi na makuhani walimsifu Mwenyezi-Mungu kila siku, walimwimbia kwa nguvu zao zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Hezekia aliwasifu na kuwatia moyo makuhani kwa kuwa waliendesha ibada kwa ujuzi mwingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya kumaliza siku saba wakati ambao watu walikula, wakatoa sadaka za amani na kumtukuza Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa babu zao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watu waliamua kwa kauli moja kuziendeleza sherehe kwa muda wa siku saba zaidi. Basi, wakaendelea kusherehekea kwa furaha kuu kwa muda wa siku saba zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Hezekia wa Yuda aliwapa watu waliokusanyika jumla ya mafahali 1,000 na kondoo 7,000. Hali kadhalika, wakuu wakawapa mafahali 1,000 na kondoo 10,000. Idadi kubwa ya makuhani walijitakasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila mtu aliyehudhuria alifurahi sana. Watu wote wa Yuda, makuhani na Walawi, wakazi wa Yerusalemu waliohudhuria, wageni waliotoka nje ya Yerusalemu na wale walioishi Yuda, wote walifurahi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukawa na furaha kuu mno Yerusalemu, maana tangu enzi ya mfalme Solomoni mwana wa Daudi, mfalme wa Israeli, jambo kama hilo lilikuwa halijatokea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, makuhani na Walawi wakawaombea watu baraka zake Mwenyezi-Mungu, naye katika makao yake matakatifu huko mbinguni akayasikia maombi yao na kuyakubali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
